# Linguist counts nothing under .github/ (its vendor rule `(^|/)\.github/`), so
# this repository reported no language at all, and CodeQL default setup, which
# takes its languages from Linguist, analyzed only the workflows. The Python
# scripts are this repository's own code: they are the checks that keep the
# contract honest. `linguist-vendored=false` brings them back into detection;
# `linguist-detectable=true` alone would not, because vendored files are
# excluded before detectability is considered.
.github/scripts/*.py linguist-vendored=false linguist-detectable=true
